1
00:04:48,571 --> 00:04:54,571
Running out of time. And lives.

2
00:09:37,142 --> 00:09:43,142
Boss Level is a action, science fiction, thriller film directed by Joe Carnahan.

3
00:14:25,714 --> 00:14:31,714
A former special forces agent is trapped in a time loop
and relives his death over and over again.

4
00:19:14,285 --> 00:19:20,285
To escape the terrible situation, he must track
down those responsible and stop them.

5
00:24:02,857 --> 00:24:08,857
Roy Pulver, played by Frank Grillo.

6
00:28:51,428 --> 00:28:57,428
Colonel Clive Ventor, played by Mel Gibson.

7
00:33:40,000 --> 00:33:46,000
Jemma Wells, played by Naomi Watts.

8
00:38:28,571 --> 00:38:34,571
Brett, played by Will Sasso.

9
00:43:17,142 --> 00:43:23,142
Alice, played by Annabelle Wallis.

10
00:48:05,714 --> 00:48:11,714
Dave, played by Sheaun McKinney.

11
00:52:54,285 --> 00:53:00,285
Boss Level is a 2020 American science fiction action film directed by Joe Carnahan and
written by Carnahan, Chris Borey, and Eddie Borey, from a story by the Boreys.

12
00:57:42,857 --> 00:57:48,857
It stars Frank Grillo as a retired special forces soldier who tries to
escape a never-ending time loop that results in his death.

13
01:02:31,428 --> 01:02:37,428
Mel Gibson, Annabelle Wallis, Naomi Watts, and Michelle Yeoh co-star.

14
01:07:20,000 --> 01:07:26,000
Originally announced in 2012 as Continue, it was developed by Carnahan at 20th
Century Fox but did not move forward and sat in development hell.

15
01:12:08,571 --> 01:12:14,571
It was resuscitated in November 2017, with Carnahan, Grillo, Lorenzo di Bonaventura, and Mark
Vahradian producing, and Randall Emmett and George Furla producing and financing.

16
01:16:57,142 --> 01:17:03,142
Filming took place in Georgia from March to May 2018.

17
01:21:45,714 --> 01:21:51,714
It was acquired for theatrical release by Entertainment Studios Motion
Pictures on August 16, 2018, but dropped by the distributor.

18
01:26:34,285 --> 01:26:40,285
The film was eventually released in the United States on
March 5, 2021 direct to streaming on Hulu.

19
01:31:22,857 --> 01:31:28,857
The film explores themes of video game, time loop,
philosophical, satirical, absurd.

20
01:36:11,428 --> 01:36:17,428
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
